603\nRickwood, D., McEachran, J., Saw, A., Telford, N., Trethowan, J., & McGorry, P. (2023). Sixteen years of innovation in youth mental healthcare: Outcomes for young people attending Australia’s headspace centre services. PloS One, 18 (6), e0282040–e0282040. https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0282040\nSlade, T., Grove, R., & Burgess, P. (2011). Kessler Psychological Distress Scale: Normative Data from the 2007 Australian National Survey of Mental Health and Wellbeing. Australian and New Zealand Journal of Psychiatry, 45 (4), 308–316. https://doi.org/10.3109/00048674.2010.543653",
